/span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>3.报名</span></span></strong><span>：填写《夏令营申请表》（见附件），于</span><strong><span>2025年8月22日前</span></strong><span>将本表及相关证明材料（学生证、各类获奖证书、课题、学术论文、成绩证明、出版物或其它原创性成果等）电子版一并发至</span><strong><span>904576726@qq.com</span></strong><span>。审核后将通过发件邮箱发放夏令营开营通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>附件</span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XU9cbBGxcXO_SjjEVyHM1w?click_id=18\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">申请表</a></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/chxzQD5fAsvMWiaOIPHhibS8iaJPuuRJib9uwwYR46oeL7jRRd8I15VzCvJrd1Sd60PvwO6ibyTPb86Ev9egfKnVtZA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Part.04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营注意事项</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.营员提交的材料必须真实、准确，一经发现弄虚作假，即取消参营资格，并告知所在学校。</span></p><p><span>2.参营期间营员须严格遵守江西中医药大学的相关规定，听从统一安排，未经同意不得随意活动。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/chxzQD5fAsvMWiaOIPHhibS8iaJPuuRJib9uX1KlN6ibKzibHr8luCJVNsTos8l15CcXTG94K6qEz9Gv8hLjq3ESvuYA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><sectio